  "hints": [
    "Each number is either in a subset or not: n yes/no choices give 2^n subsets. How do you walk through every combination of those choices?",
    "Write a recursive helper backtrack(start, path). Every call's path is a valid subset, so record a copy of it first. Then try adding each nums[i] with i >= start.",
    "After the recursive call returns, pop the number you pushed (un-choose) before trying the next i. Record [...path], not path itself, or every entry ends up the same array."
  ],
